{
  "$comment": [
    "The distro registry (ART-research-distro-profiles.md §4). Data, not code:",
    "one entry per AmigaOS distribution the OS Builder can work with.",
    "",
    "Nothing here is content. ART ships no OS, no ROM and no distro image, and",
    "downloads none of them — `homepage` is where the user goes themselves, and",
    "`licence_model` is what the screen says about that before they do.",
    "",
    "`default_cmdline_tokens` are checked against `core/pistorm`'s own list by",
    "`every_token_a_profile_names_is_one_emu68_has`, so a profile cannot",
    "reintroduce a token Emu68 does not read (ART-090).",
    "",
    "`available: false` means registered and described but not yet buildable —",
    "shown as Coming Later rather than hidden (spec §96)."
  ],
